                FP: <library> bundles <other-library> only for tests; CVE does not affect runtime.
                Review by: YYYY-MM-DD
            ]]></notes>
            <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/io\.example/.*@.*$</packageUrl>
            <cve>CVE-XXXX-YYYY</cve>
        </suppress>
    -->
</suppressions>
